      "comment": "BETTORLEFTALONE (8) resumes from a spell of four months after showing some very good form last campaign, highlighted by a win at Menangle and another one here. Draws on the back row but races well when fresh and should be ready to go off a second in a city trial. AGENTOFGOODINTENT (9) led and fought on for second last start at Menangle, beaten 2.7 metres, after scoring at the previous appearance to be unbeaten at this circuit. If things go his way from the back row he could keep that perfect record intact. BOULDERS BEACH (6) draws wider but stuck on to place here last start. SEABOW (5) is worth including off a solid fourth form the back row last week.",
